  "content": "<p data-pid=\"9Rm2RX9q\">有，我就消费过不少国内百合向作品：</p><h2>漫画</h2><h3>关于被班上绿茶威胁那件事</h3><p data-pid=\"XY5-mBdu\">在广州百合 only（广州小橘 only）和成都百合 only 入了实体书，超级火，入场十五分钟就没了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-41a07e744125442a39ef31dfd30421cd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"5314\" data-rawheight=\"4034\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-41a07e744125442a39ef31dfd30421cd\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"5314\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-41a07e744125442a39ef31dfd30421cd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;5314&#39; height=&#39;4034&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"5314\" data-rawheight=\"4034\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-41a07e744125442a39ef31dfd30421cd\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"5314\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-41a07e744125442a39ef31dfd30421cd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-41a07e744125442a39ef31dfd30421cd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>木木雪雪</h3><p data-pid=\"Ff38oknP\">严格意义上不是一部漫画，而是一系列设定和相关小故事，也是在广百 only 和成百 only 入的。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8929a0caf4587b7422041cff1568d45d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"4257\" data-rawheight=\"4594\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-8929a0caf4587b7422041cff1568d45d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"4257\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8929a0caf4587b7422041cff1568d45d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;4257&#39; height=&#39;4594&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"4257\" data-rawheight=\"4594\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-8929a0caf4587b7422041cff1568d45d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"4257\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8929a0caf4587b7422041cff1568d45d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8929a0caf4587b7422041cff1568d45d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>浮世绮想秘话 &amp; 红线交缠如茧</h3><p data-pid=\"G1E10V_z\">盲目旅人老师的原创角色（三人组）的各种平行宇宙故事，很扭曲，很喜欢。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-4d73720bbfaee2fed7838caca2717ef9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"3746\" data-rawheight=\"5651\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4d73720bbfaee2fed7838caca2717ef9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"3746\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4d73720bbfaee2fed7838caca2717ef9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;3746&#39; height=&#39;5651&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"3746\" data-rawheight=\"5651\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4d73720bbfaee2fed7838caca2717ef9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"3746\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4d73720bbfaee2fed7838caca2717ef9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-4d73720bbfaee2fed7838caca2717ef9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>我的妈妈是大明星</h3><p data-pid=\"tOXAN4BI\">买这个在成百排了一个小时队，太疯狂了，有作者亲签。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e46ce6f76eda361f9d395c1182350fff_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"5707\" data-rawheight=\"4055\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-e46ce6f76eda361f9d395c1182350fff\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"5707\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e46ce6f76eda361f9d395c1182350fff_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;5707&#39; height=&#39;4055&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"5707\" data-rawheight=\"4055\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-e46ce6f76eda361f9d395c1182350fff\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"5707\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e46ce6f76eda361f9d395c1182350fff_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e46ce6f76eda361f9d395c1182350fff_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>手握鲜花之人无需神祇</h3><p data-pid=\"9JfsS-fU\">这个画风过于日式以至于我当时还以为是什么日本画师的作品，看到最后发现是国人画师，很强。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-85c5faaffd6083ace3a10fa0ccbdcc30_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"5707\" data-rawheight=\"2780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-85c5faaffd6083ace3a10fa0ccbdcc30\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"5707\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-85c5faaffd6083ace3a10fa0ccbdcc30_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;5707&#39; height=&#39;2780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"5707\" data-rawheight=\"2780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-85c5faaffd6083ace3a10fa0ccbdcc30\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"5707\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-85c5faaffd6083ace3a10fa0ccbdcc30_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-85c5faaffd6083ace3a10fa0ccbdcc30_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3><span class=\"nolink\">请欺负我吧，恶役小姐！</span></h3><p data-pid=\"6qkYsIT8\">B 漫全解锁，原作是在刺猬猫上连载的小说，我也全看了，可惜作者已经失踪好久了，坑好像没填完。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2f64be19907b9ccfb5577ef89adbe148_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1179\" data-rawheight=\"2556\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-2f64be19907b9ccfb5577ef89adbe148\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1179\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2f64be19907b9ccfb5577ef89adbe148_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1179&#39; height=&#39;2556&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1179\" data-rawheight=\"2556\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-2f64be19907b9ccfb5577ef89adbe148\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1179\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2f64be19907b9ccfb5577ef89adbe148_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2f64be19907b9ccfb5577ef89adbe148_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>小说</h2><p data-pid=\"jMh2Wwnq\">除了《请欺负我吧，恶役小姐！》就没看过什么原创小说了，毕竟日本那边的百合轻小说我都来不及看呢（</p><h2>动画</h2><h3>风灵玉秀</h3><p data-pid=\"ZayLWmNf\">听说过，但还没看。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-b5254733f6936da0cb12a85449c5e209_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-b5254733f6936da0cb12a85449c5e209\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b5254733f6936da0cb12a85449c5e209_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;720&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-b5254733f6936da0cb12a85449c5e209\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b5254733f6936da0cb12a85449c5e209_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-b5254733f6936da0cb12a85449c5e209_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>呼唤少女</h3><p data-pid=\"by5QJ41f\">目前本篇还没出，很急。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5749c8b53e151734cdc057c4498fa0ce_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1024\" data-rawheight=\"579\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-5749c8b53e151734cdc057c4498fa0ce\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1024\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5749c8b53e151734cdc057c4498fa0ce_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1024&#39; height=&#39;579&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1024\" data-rawheight=\"579\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-5749c8b53e151734cdc057c4498fa0ce\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1024\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5749c8b53e151734cdc057c4498fa0ce_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5749c8b53e151734cdc057c4498fa0ce_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>厨出凤城</h3><p data-pid=\"kMq5gAVw\">不知道要鸽到什么时候</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d99e0bbc9b812d09b61bfca42b375698_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-d99e0bbc9b812d09b61bfca42b375698\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d99e0bbc9b812d09b61bfca42b375698_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;720&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-d99e0bbc9b812d09b61bfca42b375698\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d99e0bbc9b812d09b61bfca42b375698_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d99e0bbc9b812d09b61bfca42b375698_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>游戏</h2><p data-pid=\"jq1wgZMM\">都是在 steam 上买的。虽然想把《重返未来 1999》放进去，但是由于我玩不动手游，后面就纯云了。</p><h3>彷徨之街</h3><p data-pid=\"qioyx3YZ\">避雷！我玩得时候尬得抠脚</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-1b15e9dc3f9c0f98bac5632f7d179993_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-1b15e9dc3f9c0f98bac5632f7d179993\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1b15e9dc3f9c0f98bac5632f7d179993_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-1b15e9dc3f9c0f98bac5632f7d179993\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1b15e9dc3f9c0f98bac5632f7d179993_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-1b15e9dc3f9c0f98bac5632f7d179993_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>不恋爱就完蛋了</h3><p data-pid=\"ogfVk87o\">还行，但我对玄幻要素不太感冒</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-5fdf70e4069cf9f19c606eced69b59f5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-5fdf70e4069cf9f19c606eced69b59f5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5fdf70e4069cf9f19c606eced69b59f5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-5fdf70e4069cf9f19c606eced69b59f5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5fdf70e4069cf9f19c606eced69b59f5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-5fdf70e4069cf9f19c606eced69b59f5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>仅你一人</h3><p data-pid=\"BCMvCYRQ\">听说有病娇，还没玩呢</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-49655140cad0fc4c82774c296657eeb7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-49655140cad0fc4c82774c296657eeb7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-49655140cad0fc4c82774c296657eeb7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-49655140cad0fc4c82774c296657eeb7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-49655140cad0fc4c82774c296657eeb7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-49655140cad0fc4c82774c296657eeb7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>梦灯花</h3><p data-pid=\"Xfcrhf1l\">吹爆！战斗爽！还有多结局，比较杀时间。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1e535c96b9847ff330d83d486eefdcf5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-1e535c96b9847ff330d83d486eefdcf5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-1e535c96b9847ff330d83d486eefdcf5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-1e535c96b9847ff330d83d486eefdcf5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-1e535c96b9847ff330d83d486eefdcf5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1e535c96b9847ff330d83d486eefdcf5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>秘密舞会</h3><p data-pid=\"PnbQXsmx\">白露社聆花百合系列的小品，作为甜点来说不错</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ef2129dae5321c9ac2cb4c2e36733981_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-ef2129dae5321c9ac2cb4c2e36733981\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ef2129dae5321c9ac2cb4c2e36733981_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-ef2129dae5321c9ac2cb4c2e36733981\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ef2129dae5321c9ac2cb4c2e36733981_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ef2129dae5321c9ac2cb4c2e36733981_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>南栀</h3><p data-pid=\"pLVdEtLm\">聆花百合系列结局，平稳落地，但我感觉糖分不足，内心纠结太多。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a42b223ad8345ff1caa8c4be8558e410_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-a42b223ad8345ff1caa8c4be8558e410\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a42b223ad8345ff1caa8c4be8558e410_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-a42b223ad8345ff1caa8c4be8558e410\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a42b223ad8345ff1caa8c4be8558e410_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a42b223ad8345ff1caa8c4be8558e410_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>千面</h3><p data-pid=\"vuQBCw-1\">个人心目中聆花百合系列最好的一部。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3a5bfa4a29a30a1eab2154e7ddd9e007_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-3a5bfa4a29a30a1eab2154e7ddd9e007\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3a5bfa4a29a30a1eab2154e7ddd9e007_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-3a5bfa4a29a30a1eab2154e7ddd9e007\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3a5bfa4a29a30a1eab2154e7ddd9e007_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3a5bfa4a29a30a1eab2154e7ddd9e007_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>茜色</h3><p data-pid=\"wOuk0OIK\">和《仅你一人》的捆绑包打折入的，还没玩</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0251511fba78482c1d584361ff09fc58_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-0251511fba78482c1d584361ff09fc58\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0251511fba78482c1d584361ff09fc58_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-0251511fba78482c1d584361ff09fc58\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0251511fba78482c1d584361ff09fc58_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0251511fba78482c1d584361ff09fc58_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>夜永</h3><p data-pid=\"AdCUaHdS\">异国恋，文化差异还挺有意思，但整体而言有点平淡</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-cec8702e38a91f1b0e382a5a850236dd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cec8702e38a91f1b0e382a5a850236dd\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cec8702e38a91f1b0e382a5a850236dd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cec8702e38a91f1b0e382a5a850236dd\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cec8702e38a91f1b0e382a5a850236dd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-cec8702e38a91f1b0e382a5a850236dd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>纸房子</h3><p data-pid=\"Ja3ci30Y\">听说和写实，还没玩</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3c3552478c0c4f77ada1b4b3b8d20f42_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-3c3552478c0c4f77ada1b4b3b8d20f42\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3c3552478c0c4f77ada1b4b3b8d20f42_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-3c3552478c0c4f77ada1b4b3b8d20f42\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3c3552478c0c4f77ada1b4b3b8d20f42_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3c3552478c0c4f77ada1b4b3b8d20f42_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>寄牲</h3><p data-pid=\"Dbcxw2jS\">聆花百合的起点，玩了叙诡，还挺有意思，就是收集全结局需要玩四遍，有点坐牢</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4fd9506dd257926642802353d939f244_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4fd9506dd257926642802353d939f244\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4fd9506dd257926642802353d939f244_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1221&#39; height=&#39;390&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1221\" data-rawheight=\"390\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4fd9506dd257926642802353d939f244\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1221\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4fd9506dd257926642802353d939f244_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4fd9506dd257926642802353d939f244_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"2JsValYF\">更多百合作品请见：</p><a data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1088994950\" data-draft-title=\"我看过的百合向作品+印象（2026-01-18 更新；125 部作品/系列；新增喜欢的画师 23 位）\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8fd91c5de801f89993b0fd0edcd957d3.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">我看过的百合向作品+印象（2026-01-18 更新；125 部作品/系列；新增喜欢的画师 23 位）</a><p></p>",
